title: "My postdoctoral appointment at Rutgers University starts today!"
date: 2026-05-01
---

Very excited to start a postdoctoral associate appointment at Rutgers University with Dr. Nicole Fahrenfeld. Looking forward to working in a DoD funded collaborative project with Dr. Fahrenfeld, Dr. Arbuckle at RU Camden and collaborators at Temple University and CDM Smith. 
The collaborative project will focus on microplastics impacted by PFAS.
